{
  "Combat.GreenSlime.Attack.Text": "You are struck a glancing blow by [themonster]! "
  "Combat.GreenSlime.CameWorms": "[pg]The slime doesn't even seem to notice.[pg]"
  "Combat.GreenSlime.LustAttack.Lead": "The creature surges forward slowly with a swing that you easily manage to avoid. You notice traces of green liquid spurting from its body as it moves."
  "Combat.GreenSlime.LustAttack.Text": "The creature surges forward slowly with a swing that you easily manage to avoid. You notice traces of green liquid spurt from the creature as it does, forming a thin mist that makes your skin tingle with excitement when you inhale it."
  "Combat.GreenSlime.LustReduction.Lead": "The creature collapses backwards as its cohesion begins to give out, and the faint outline of eyes and a mouth form on its surface, looking satisfied."
  "Combat.GreenSlime.LustReduction.Text": "The creature collapses backwards as its cohesion begins to give out, and the faint outline of eyes and a mouth form on its face. Its chest heaves as if it were gasping, and the bolt upright erection it sports visibly quivers and pulses before relaxing slightly."
}
